msgid ""
"Clear out everything computed automatically, for all papers: automatic "
"venues and their variants, which venue each source text belongs to, the "
"papers' automatic venues and kinds, and the cached ranking matches. "
"Everything set by hand is kept (venue levels, records, kinds, names, "
"variants and rules; papers' venues, validated sources, ranks, tracks, "
"corrections, tags and notes). Then everything is matched again."
msgstr ""
"Effacer tout ce qui a été calculé automatiquement, pour tous les articles"
" : les canaux de publication automatiques et leurs variantes, le canal "
"auquel appartient chaque texte de source, les canaux et types "
"automatiques des articles, et les appariements de classement en cache. "
