msgid ""
"Venues are classified in two levels: first their kind (preprint, national"
" or international conference or journal), then their rank. Ranked venues "
"(CORE, Scimago, JCR) are international; other venues are classified with "
"the keywords below. Kinds can be set by hand on a venue or a paper."
